3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,290
很不错的大学
A fine institution.

4
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:12,870
阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦教过书的地方
The place where Albert Einstein taught,

5
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:14,990
莱纳德也是在那里拿到博士学位
and where Leonard got his PhD,

6
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:16,950
所以那学校可能没落了
so it may have gone downhill.

7
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:20,030
各位  还记得诺维茨基博士吗
Gentlemen, you may remember Dr. Nowitzki.

8
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:22,850
她又回来加州理工读博士后啦
She's back at Caltech for her postdoc.

9
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:29,460
问一下  你是想和我发展恋爱关系吗
Question. are you seeking a romantic relationship with me?

10
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,210
如果我是呢
What if I were?

11
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:33,910
这会引起一系列的问题
Well, that would raise a number of problems.

12
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:37,010
我们是同事  我现在有女友
We're colleagues, I'm currently in a relation...

13
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:43,720
艾米  艾米
Amy? Amy.

14
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,400
艾米
Amy?

15
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:57,700
时至今日

16
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:00,520
你愿意嫁给我吗
Will you marry me?

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:04,860
请稍等我一下
One moment, please.

18
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:08,390
不是吧  你要在这节骨眼接电话吗
Really, you're going to answer that right now?

19
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:09,080
是莱纳德打来
It's Leonard.

20
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,900
我不想失礼嘛
I don't want to be rude.

21
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:12,340
你好
Hello?

22
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:13,490
你上哪去了
Oh, hey, where you been?

23
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:14,870
打你电话找你好久了
We've been calling you for hours.

24
00:01:14,870 --> 00:01:17,770
抱歉  我的手机之前开了飞行模式
Oh, I'm sorry, my phone was on "Airplane" mode.

25
00:01:17,770 --> 00:01:18,800
为什么
Why?

26
00:01:19,110 --> 00:01:21,630
因为我在飞机上"飞行"啊
Because I was on an airplane.

27
00:01:22,730 --> 00:01:24,250
开免提
Hey, put him on speaker.

28
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:25,920
你去哪里了
Yeah. ?Hey, where are you?

29
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:28,490
我来普林斯顿大学找艾米
I came to Princeton to see Amy.

30
00:01:28,490 --> 00:01:30,210
说来也挺有意思
It's a funny story, actually.

31
00:01:30,210 --> 00:01:32,960
我当时在跟诺维茨基博士共进午餐
I was having lunch with Dr. Nowitzki,

32
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,500
然后她亲吻了我
and she kissed me.

33
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:35,170
-什么  -啥
- Excuse me? - What?

34
00:01:35,170 --> 00:01:36,620
你说什么
I'm sorry?

35
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:39,680
在那一刻我意识到
And in that moment, I realized

36
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:42,760
艾米才是我余生
that Amy was the only woman I ever wanted to kiss

37
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,520
唯一想亲吻的女人
for the rest of my life.

38
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:48,290
所以我来新泽西跟她求婚
So I came to New Jersey to ask her to marry me.

39
00:01:48,290 --> 00:01:50,170
你真是太甜了
Oh, that's so sweet.

40
00:01:50,170 --> 00:01:52,090
-谢尔顿...  -不过呢
- Sheldon... - Yeah, although

41
00:01:52,090 --> 00:01:55,900
我的确是先去征求了某位男士的祝福
there was one man whose blessing I needed first.

42
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:59,370
我想过了  我确实想要
I've thought about it, and I really want to spend

43
00:01:59,370 --> 00:02:01,800
与艾米共度余生
the rest of my life with Amy.

44
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:04,350
你会祝福我吗
Do I have your blessing?

45
00:02:04,350 --> 00:02:06,610
谢尔顿
Well, Sheldon...

46
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:11,380
我觉得你应该将她的手指变成土星
...I think you should make her finger like Saturn

47
00:02:11,390 --> 00:02:14,460
再往她手指上套个土星"环"
and put a ring on it.

48
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:18,530
你去问了霍金博士而不是艾米父亲吗
You asked Stephen Hawking and not her father?

49
00:02:18,660 --> 00:02:20,350
霍金博士是个天才
Stephen Hawking's a genius.

50
00:02:20,350 --> 00:02:24,140
如果他不支持  我才不要浪费时间去问她爹呢
If he said no, I wasn't gonna waste my time on her father.

51
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:26,770
那你有问过我父亲吧
But you did ask my father?

52
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:28,750
有  他同意
I did. He said yes.

53
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:32,080
但不是用机械人式语音说的  所以没那么酷
Although, not in a robot voice, so it wasn't nearly as cool.

54
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:34,560
我的天啊  真不敢相信你们订婚了
Okay. Oh, my God, I can't believe you guys are engaged.

55
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,960
还没订上婚呢
We're not engaged, yet.

56
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,560
这都半天了她还不回答我
She's taking forever to answer.

57
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,640
那是因为你在讲电话
Because you're on the phone!

58
00:02:41,770 --> 00:02:43,240
我们稍后回电
We'll call you back.

59
00:02:48,930 --> 00:02:49,750
她同意了
She said yes.

60
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:51,600
恭喜你们
Yay! ?Congratulations!

61
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,290
生

62
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,290
活

63
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,290
大

64
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,290
爆

65
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,290
炸

66
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,290
第十一季  第一集

67
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,640
母亲  我有好消息与你分享
Mother, I have some good news to share.

68
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,050
我们订婚啦
We're engaged.

69
00:03:24,870 --> 00:03:27,960
我真为你们开心  但我一点都不惊讶
I am so happy for you two, but I'm not surprised.

70
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,380
我为此事祈祷多时了
I've been praying for this.

71
00:03:29,390 --> 00:03:31,200
这件事上帝没半点功劳
Well, God had nothing to do with it.

72
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:34,200
完全是因为我跟别的女人接了吻
It happened because I was kissing another woman,

73
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:37,550
令我意识到我想跟艾米共度余生
and it made me realize I wanted to be with Amy.

74
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,680
居然有超过一名女性对你有兴趣
More than one woman was interested in you?

75
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:42,000
我可能祈祷太猛了
I might have prayed a little too hard.

76
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:43,800
等等  我想先...
Wait, oh, and I just...

77
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,120
我想现在就跟你说清楚
I want to let you know right now

78
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,230
我们不会在教堂里成婚
that we are not getting married in a church.

79
00:03:47,230 --> 00:03:48,280
没关系  谢尔顿
That's all right, Sheldon.

80
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:51,240
耶稣在哪里  那便是教堂
Anywhere Jesus is is a church.

81
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,680
但他不会在我们婚礼上
Well, he won't be at our wedding.

82
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,820
他会在我心里  所以只要我人在
He's in my heart, so if I'm there,

83
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:56,390
他就在
he'll be there.

84
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,050
行  那他就是你带的伴
Okay, well, then, he's your plus-one.

85
00:03:58,050 --> 00:04:00,080
你带人的名额就用完了
You don't get to bring anyone else.

86
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,680
没关系  爱你
That's fine. Love you.

87
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,650
我也爱你  再见
Love you, too. Bye.

88
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,660
主啊  谢谢您
Lord, thank you.

89
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:08,660
虽然您无所不能
Even though you can do anything,

90
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:12,390
但这事真显出了您的无上威能
that was mighty impressive.

91
00:04:13,430 --> 00:04:14,690
我们订婚了
We're engaged.

92
00:04:14,690 --> 00:04:16,650
天啊  太棒了
Oh, my God, that's amazing!

93
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:18,420
慢着  快告诉我整个经过
Wait, uh, tell me everything.

94
00:04:18,420 --> 00:04:20,850
是这样的  诺维茨基博士亲了我
Well, Dr. Nowitzki was kissing me...

95
00:04:20,850 --> 00:04:23,520
你可以别再用这事当故事开头了
Okay, you can stop leading with that part of the story.

96
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:25,990
恭喜你们啊
Well, congratulations.

97
00:04:25,990 --> 00:04:27,590
太为你们俩高兴了
I'm so happy for you two.

98
00:04:27,590 --> 00:04:29,050
稍等  我得告诉伯纳黛特
Hold on, I have to tell Bernadette.

99
00:04:29,380 --> 00:04:30,780
妮妮  你猜怎么着
Hey, Bernie, guess what?

100
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:33,680
谢尔顿跟艾米订婚啦  你敢信吗
Sheldon and Amy got engaged. Can you believe it?

101
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:38,010
天啊  我真不敢相信
Oh, my God. I cannot believe it.

102
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:42,790
她好像高兴到...  在喜极而泣啊
She's so happy... I think she's crying.

103
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:46,970
你觉得谢尔顿会想要办一场
Do you think Sheldon's gonna want

104
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:49,790
奇葩的《星舰迷航》风婚礼吗
some weird Star Trek wedding?

105
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:52,610
我不知道
I don't know.

106
00:04:52,610 --> 00:04:54,240
莱纳德当时想说
Well, Leonard could barely finish the words

107
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,670
"《神秘博士》婚礼蛋糕"
"Doctor Who wedding cake"

108
00:04:55,670 --> 00:04:58,170
还没说完就被我狠狠拒绝
before I shut that down hard.

109
00:05:01,110 --> 00:05:02,540
你有在听我说话吗
Are you listening to me?

110
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:05,020
有啊  你对莱纳德毫无人性  我听到了
Yeah, you're mean to Leonard. I heard you.

111
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:08,190
你还好吗
Is everything okay?

112
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,310
我要告诉你一件事
Look, I'm gonna tell you something,

113
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,680
但你不许惊慌失措
but you can't freak out,

114
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,660
因为我已经很手足无措了
because I'm already freaking out.

115
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:15,700
天啊  什么事
Oh, my God, what is it?

116
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:17,290
我又怀孕了
I'm pregnant again.

117
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:18,630
什...
Wha...

118
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:27,550
有点儿意思
Interesting.

119
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:31,880
霍华德知道了会疯的
Howard's gonna lose his mind.

120
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,320
慢着  你还没告诉他吗
Wait, you haven't told him yet?

121
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,290
没有
No.

122
00:05:34,290 --> 00:05:37,050
你第一个告诉我吗  妮妮小亲亲
You told me first? Oh, Bernie!

123
00:05:38,650 --> 00:05:41,130
这事不应该啊  我们很小心的
This wasn't supposed to happen-- we were careful.

124
00:05:41,130 --> 00:05:42,220
对啊  我本来还以为哺乳期内
Yeah, I didn't even think you could get pregnant

125
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:43,340
女人是不会怀孕的呢
while you were breastfeeding.

126
00:05:43,340 --> 00:05:45,560
结果呢  老娘就怀了
Well, guess what? You can.

127
00:05:46,690 --> 00:05:48,410
好吧  听着  这是桩好事
Okay, look, look, this is a good thing.

128
00:05:48,410 --> 00:05:49,790
这样哈雷就会有个弟弟
Halley's gonna have a little brother

129
00:05:49,790 --> 00:05:51,460
或者妹妹陪她玩了
or sister to play with.

130
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:53,770
我想那应该是会挺有爱
I guess that would be pretty cute.

131
00:05:53,770 --> 00:05:55,730
你知道吗  我也是我爸妈的意外之喜
And, you, know, I was a surprise to my parents,

132
00:05:55,730 --> 00:05:57,060
我爸说我是发生在他们身上
and my dad said it was the best thing

133
00:05:57,060 --> 00:05:58,990
最美好的事
that ever happened to them.

134
00:05:58,990 --> 00:06:02,230
好吧  也许这个宝宝是上天的恩赐
Okay. Maybe this baby actually is a blessing.

135
00:06:02,230 --> 00:06:04,460
天啊  亲爱的  当然了
Oh, my God, honey, of course it is.

136
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,330
我怎么会又怀上了呢
How am I pregnant again?

137
00:06:07,330 --> 00:06:09,590
对啊  你们怎么搞的
Yeah, what were you thinking?

138
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:16,120
机票确认好了
All right, I'm all checked in to my flight.

139
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,990
你要走了我好难过
Well, I'm sad you're leaving.

140
00:06:17,990 --> 00:06:20,370
为什么你订当天来回呢
Why'd you only book a flight for one day?

141
00:06:20,370 --> 00:06:22,610
我来是为了求婚
I came here to propose.

142
00:06:22,610 --> 00:06:24,560
要是你拒绝我  我可不想
If you'd said no, I wouldn't want to stick around

143
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,910
留下来看着你的蠢样
looking at your stupid face.

144
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,540
是这样的  只有你拒绝我的情况下
Now, mind you, your face is only stupid

145
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:33,010
你才会是一脸蠢样
in the "No" version of the story.

146
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:37,290
但我答应了  现在能享用你这货一辈子
But I said yes, so I get a lifetime of this.

147
00:06:37,290 --> 00:06:39,960
是啊  聪明样
Yes, you do, smart face.

148
00:06:40,490 --> 00:06:42,730
不如你多待几天吧
Why don't you stay a few extra days?

149
00:06:42,730 --> 00:06:44,720
我没带别的衣服
Well, I don't have any other clothes.

150
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,790
我们可以去买
We'll get you some.

151
00:06:45,790 --> 00:06:47,900
不要了吧  我这个人很挑的
Oh, I don't know, I'm pretty particular.

152
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:50,500
离这儿不到1600米的地方有家漫画店
Well, there's a comic book store less than a mile from here.

153
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:52,990
棒  买买买
Perfect, let's go shopping.

154
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:56,390
对了  我今晚要跟同事共进晚餐
Oh, um, and I'm having dinner with some colleagues tonight.

155
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:58,330
他们会很高兴见到你的
I'm sure they'd love to meet you.

156
00:06:59,110 --> 00:07:01,040
来嘛  好不好
Come on, what do you say?

157
00:07:01,770 --> 00:07:04,100
你开始用烦我的招数了
Aw, you're nagging me.

158
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:06,890
感觉我们已经结婚了似的
It's like we're already married.

159
00:07:06,890 --> 00:07:08,200
那到底好不好嘛
Is that a yes or a no?

160
00:07:08,210 --> 00:07:11,270
天啊  留点力等蜜月了再叨逼叨吧
Geez, save some for the honeymoon.

161
00:07:14,250 --> 00:07:16,030
瞧  那是诺维茨基
Look at Nowitzki over there.

162
00:07:16,030 --> 00:07:19,030
不敢相信她想从艾米身边

I can't believe she tried to steal Sheldon from Amy.

163
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:20,240
瞧好了
You know what?

164
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:22,340
我要过去告诉她  他们订婚了
I'm gonna go there and tell her that they're engaged now

165
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:24,170
她的小把戏落空了
and that her little plan didn't work.

166
00:07:24,170 --> 00:07:25,480
这是因为你想维护谢尔顿
Because you're sticking up for Sheldon,

167
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,430
还是因为你还在气她拒绝了你
or because you're still mad she rejected you?

168
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:30,130
距离太远  听不到你在讲什么
Too far away, can't hear you.

169
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,640
你好  拉蒙娜
Hello, Ramona.

170
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:33,670
你好
Hello.

171
00:07:33,950 --> 00:07:36,440
怎么独自一人坐在这呢
Why are you sitting by yourself?

172
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:37,710
我知道了
Oh, that's right,

173
00:07:37,710 --> 00:07:41,790
谢尔顿在新泽西  他和艾米订婚了
Sheldon's in New Jersey being engaged to Amy.

174
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:43,500
我听说了
I heard.

175
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:45,170
现在谢尔顿闪边去了
Now that Sheldon's out of the picture,

176
00:07:45,170 --> 00:07:48,440
我可以再给你个机会跟我约会
I could give you one more chance to go out with me.

177
00:07:49,490 --> 00:07:51,640
谢邀  不用了
Nope, I'm good.

178
00:07:53,790 --> 00:07:54,880
你确定吗
You sure?

179
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:58,140
小爷可不会再问第二次
I will not ask again.

180
00:07:58,710 --> 00:08:01,560
我真心希望你不会再问了
I sincerely hope not.

181
00:08:02,570 --> 00:08:03,610
行吧
Very well.

182
00:08:03,670 --> 00:08:07,130
那在气氛变尴尬之前我先撤了
I'm going to leave before this gets awkward.

183
00:08:11,410 --> 00:08:12,890
要我做晚饭吗
Want me to make dinner?

184
