00:16:13,870 --> 00:16:18,330
但如果有冲马桶的声音  谈话立刻结束
But if I hear a flush, this conversation is over.

366
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:22,080
那些人的面前有一位世界级的智者
Those people were in the presence of a world-class mind,

367
00:16:22,110 --> 00:16:25,150
而他们却只想聊那些无聊废话
and all they wanted to talk about was their own nonsense.

368
00:16:25,490 --> 00:16:28,690
你能听出其中的讽刺意味吗
Can you see the irony in that statement?

369
00:16:31,150 --> 00:16:32,510
听出来没
How about now?

370
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:37,040
现在呢
How about now?

371
00:16:40,230 --> 00:16:41,390
我等你慢慢想
I'll wait.

372
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:46,070
惊喜
Surprise.

373
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:48,470
糟了  今天是我们的纪念日吗
Oh, crap, is it our anniversary?

374
00:16:50,210 --> 00:16:51,680
不  等一下
No. Wait.

375
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,330
-不  -不是
- No. - No.

376
00:16:57,210 --> 00:16:58,970
好吧  那我们是在庆祝什么事
All right, so what are we celebrating?

377
00:16:58,970 --> 00:17:01,760
你知道  博纳黛特和霍华德又怀孕了
Well, you know, Bernadette and Howard are pregnant again,

378
00:17:01,760 --> 00:17:03,290
艾米和谢尔顿也要结婚了
and Amy and Sheldon are getting married.

379
00:17:03,290 --> 00:17:05,230
我不想让你感到受冷落
I didn't want you to feel left out.

380
00:17:05,870 --> 00:17:07,000
什么  受冷落吗
Ah. Left out?

381
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,880
博纳黛特肚子里要长一个小宝宝
Well, Bernadette has to grow a baby inside of her,

382
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:10,190
艾米马上要嫁给另一个小宝宝
and Amy has to marry one.

383
00:17:10,190 --> 00:17:11,670
我的人生非常圆满
My life is great.

384
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:15,160
所以你不想吃这蛋糕了吗
So do you not want the cake?

385
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:17,560
你把它端走试试  看你怎么死
Try and take it away, see what happens.

386
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:22,630
糟了  今天真是我们结婚纪念日
Oh, crap, it is our anniversary.

387
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:25,310
结婚纪念日快乐
Happy anniversary!

388
00:17:29,810 --> 00:17:30,670
艾米
Amy.

389
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:34,130
有些事我要告诉你
There's something I need to say to you.

390
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:36,160
我听着呢
I'm listening.

391
00:17:37,550 --> 00:17:40,890
我一直在想复仇者联盟
I've been thinking about the Avengers.

392
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:43,850
我相信
I believe that.

393
00:17:45,180 --> 00:17:47,720
但我觉得这没什么好跟我说的
But I don't think that's something you needed to say to me.

394
00:17:48,450 --> 00:17:52,140
我意识到钢铁侠超屌
I realized that Iron Man is great.

395
00:17:52,290 --> 00:17:55,400
但同时  美国队长也很不错
And also, that Captain America is great.

396
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:59,040
有时钢铁侠还会出现在美国队长的电影里
And sometimes, Iron Man is in a Captain America movie,

397
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:02,000
他也不会因为这不是钢铁侠电影而生气
and he's not mad it's not an Iron Man movie.

398
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,930
他只是帅气飞来  让观众热血沸腾
You know, he can fly in, give the audience a thrill,

399
00:18:04,930 --> 00:18:06,350
然后再霸气飞走
and then fly away.

400
00:18:06,830 --> 00:18:09,300
我今晚应该这么表现才对
And that should've been me tonight.

401
00:18:09,950 --> 00:18:13,670
我应该当你电影中的讨喜龙套
I should've been the delightful cameo in your movie.

402
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,730
谢谢你  谢尔顿
Thank you, Sheldon.

403
00:18:17,280 --> 00:18:18,740
相反的  我表现得像暴怒的绿巨人一样...
Instead, I was like the Hulk, and I...

404
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:20,750
够了  请不要再提复仇者联盟了
Okay, please stop talking about the Avengers.

405
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:23,620
总而言之
Anyway.

406
00:18:24,930 --> 00:18:26,240
我为你骄傲
I'm proud of you.

407
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:28,690
我以后会尽量学习分享目光焦点
And I'm going to try to do a better job

408
00:18:28,690 --> 00:18:32,610
因为我们是同一个队的
of sharing the spotlight because we're a team.

409
00:18:32,770 --> 00:18:38,000
你懂吗  我们就像是棒球道奇队的球员
You know? Much like t-the Dodgers.

410
00:18:40,030 --> 00:18:44,340
如果他们有超能力  会打击犯罪
If they had superpowers, and fought crime.

411
00:18:44,730 --> 00:18:46,320
而且雷神索尔也在队里
And Thor was in them.

412
00:18:48,870 --> 00:18:50,520
谢尔顿  我知道这很不容易
Sheldon, I know this isn't easy,

413
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:54,410
但你会有一辈子来慢慢练习
but you'll have a whole lifetime to practice.

414
00:18:55,150 --> 00:18:57,860
也许真的需要这么久  我对此非常不在行
I-It could take that long, I'm really bad at it.

415
00:19:01,580 --> 00:19:02,640
也许...
You know, maybe, um,

416
00:19:03,490 --> 00:19:06,940
我该从现在开始  赶紧回帕萨迪纳
I should start right now, and go back to Pasadena

417
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:09,990
让你好好独自享受这一切
and let you have this experience to yourself.

418
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:11,530
你就是想回到那个
You just want to go back

419
00:19:11,530 --> 00:19:13,690
大家都稀罕你的地方吧
'cause that's where everybody makes a fuss over you.

420
00:19:13,690 --> 00:19:16,730
你的同事说得对  你真是冰雪聪明
You know, your colleagues are right, you are brilliant.

421
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:26,220
3个月后

422
00:19:24,450 --> 00:19:25,320
你们好呀
Hello.

423
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:27,130
艾米  欢迎回来
Amy, welcome back.

424
00:19:27,130 --> 00:19:28,570
让我看看订婚戒指
Oh, l-let me see the ring.

425
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:30,750
美死了
Ooh, nice.

426
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:32,680
喂喂  别乱看呀
H-Hey, her eyes are up there.

427
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:37,650
那就是亲了谢尔顿的女人吗
I-Is that the woman who kissed Sheldon?

428
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:43,110
-有可能  -很难说  跟我们说说普林斯顿的事
- Uh... Could be. - Hard to say. Tell us about Princeton.

429
00:19:43,450 --> 00:19:44,530
请稍等我一会儿
Excuse me for a minute.

430
00:19:44,530 --> 00:19:47,120
不  我们之后再聊
Not-- well, we'll catch up later.

431
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,810
这将是自从我的阿姨在家族聚会上
This is going to be the biggest smackdown

432
00:19:48,810 --> 00:19:50,970
和我表姐穿了同样的沙丽之后
since my Aunt Noopur showed up at the family reunion

433
00:19:50,970 --> 00:19:54,150
最大的一次撕逼大战了
wearing the same sari as my cousin Sruti.

434
00:19:56,150 --> 00:19:58,520
诺维茨基博士
Dr. Nowitzki?

435
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:03,730
福勒博士  你好
Dr. Fowler. Um, hello.

436
00:20:04,810 --> 00:20:07,990
谢谢  我衷心谢谢你全家
Thank you. Thank you so much.

